orward person.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le16ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's good. Some bosses can be horrible.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could you be more specific, Peter? Are you talking about your boss?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Of course not. Do you think you'll always work for a magazine?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If I don't work for a magazine, I might work for another kind of publication\u2026 like a paper. What about you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I may apply to a PR firm if I see an opportunity.", "id": 2, "time": "13000", "image": "engenn5le16ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You should. Personally, I think it's a great start and will open up many possibilities for you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What do you mean by that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, before you apply you may want to do some research. You can see who they work with. It might come in handy.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What about my hand?", "id": 3, "time": "37000", "image": "engenn5le16ob11re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Gets a Job at a Magazine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "I'll Do My Best"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le16ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking about the Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Future tense (you use the modal <span class=\"strong\">will</span>in the Future tnese) to talk about actions you are going to do in the future. You can also use the modals <span class=\"strong\">might</span> and <span class=\"strong\">may</span> to talk about actions in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Might</span> means there is a smaller chance that something will happen (30%).<br/><br/>  <span class=\"strong\">May</span> means there is a slightly greater chance that something will happen (50%).<br/><br><span class=\"italic\">Example: If I don't work for a magazine, I might work for another kind of publication;  I may apply to a PR firm if I see an opportunity.</span><br><br> You can use the first conditional to talk about possible actions and situations in the future.<br/><br/>  There are two parts to the sentence. <br/><br/>  One part is the <span class=\"strong\">condition</span>. The other part is the <span class=\"strong\">result</span>.<br/><br/>   Form:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">If*</span> + <span class=\"italic\">subject</span> + <span class=\"italic\">Simple Present tense</span>  + <span class=\"italic\">subject</span> + <span class=\"italic\">will/won't</span><br/> You use a comma after the condition in this form. <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Example: If I work for a newspaper, I will learn a lot.</span><br><br> * You can use other words instead of <span class=\"italic\">if</span>, you can use <span class=\"italic\">before</span>, <span class=\"italic\">after</span> or <span class=\"italic\">when</span>.<br/><br/>  You can flip the two parts of the sentence so that the result comes first. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Before you apply</span>,<br/><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">After graduation</span>,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you may want to research the company.</span><br/><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">we will open up a business.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I will work for a magazine</span>,<br/><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I will apply for a job</span>,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">after I finish school.</span><br/><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">if I see one of interest.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "editor in chief"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person who is in charge of a group of editors; the editorial team "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you meet the editor in chief  during your meet and greet?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are the words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "magazine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large thin book that contains news stories, articles and photographs "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Will you always work for a magazine?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Opinions and Asking for Clarification "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk to people, you can use different expressions for different things :<br/> If you don't understand what a person is saying, you can ask for clarification.<br/> If you want to share your opinion, you can introduce it with an expression.<br/> Here are some expressions you can use:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expressing an Opinion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking for Clarification\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">(Personally,) I think \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">In my opinion \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would like to point out \u2026 </span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">The way I see it \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd say that \u2026 </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What did you say?</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you repeat what you said, please?</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Are you talking \u2026 ?</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you be more specific please?</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you explain what you mean?</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do you mean by that?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "publication"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a magazine, paper, etc., that is printed and made available to the public "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I might work for another kind of publication like a newspaper."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to come in handy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that will be useful"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Doing research before you interview may come in handy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "start"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the beginning of someone's job, which they will develop in the future"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This will be a great start to your career."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose one of the options: <ul><li>You are going to work for a magazine.Will you do it?</li><li>You are going to write an article for the newspaper. Will you do it?</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Which one would you choose? Write down 3-4 sentences explaining why."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the possible events and actions that may happen in the future because of your choice. Use words like <span class=\"italic\">before</span>, <span class=\"italic\">after</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">when</span> in your sentences. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I tell a friend about possible events in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about actions related to work."}]}], "type": "sena"}